---
description: Non-negotiable engineering standards for Vibe-to-Prod
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md and CONSTRAINTS.md before substantial changes.
For existing app repairs, consult `.agents/skills/v2p-rescue/SKILL.md`; before release, consult `.agents/skills/v2p-release/SKILL.md`.
Use an installed agent skill for each relevant phase; use the `using-agent-skills` router skill if present.
Cursor skills belong in `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` and rules in `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`.
Keep the agent context minimal: reference workflows rather than pasting skill bodies into this always-on rule.
A change is not done until the actual typecheck, tests, build and configured security checks pass.
Never manufacture evidence or bypass a policy to produce a green status.
